{"3124330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mortal Frame: Reforged in Survival", "steam_appid": 3124330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Mortal Frame: Reforged in Survival” is a sci-fi RPG combining open-world exploration and sandbox survival. Set in a future shaped by rapid technological advancements, breakthroughs in bioengineering and artificial intelligence present humanity with profound survival challenges and moral dilemmas. Players will explore a mysterious, uncharted island, gathering resources, crafting equipment, capturing AI companions, encountering diverse factions, and enhancing themselves through modifications to face increasingly powerful foes while unraveling the mysteries hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Body Modifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore to collect materials, enhancing or repairing their implanted modification modules to unlock new traits or increase their strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/03f26fafa128be6cf3d83b2f68070ab0.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=324 /></span>      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/782dd2b2d167ba7ed5f705dc8547cc01.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Robot Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can defeat enemies or salvage various types of robot wreckage, converting them into loyal robotic companions through repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Factions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is populated with various factions, each boasting unique stories. Players can delve into their backstory, acquire their technologies and gear, and enjoy a breadth of options and adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Weapons and Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts an arsenal of over 160 weapons and items for players to gather and craft, arming them with an array of combat choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/ec09480949a67080c2f86b542f44c4c0.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Dynamic Climate and Environmental Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delivers shifting seasons, weather patterns, and robust environmental interaction. Players have the power to alter landscapes and tailor the hues of flora across the seasons, crafting a world that reflects their vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/1e63b9baaa9d5de08ba0f6a529020c65.poster.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/1e63b9baaa9d5de08ba0f6a529020c65.webm?t=1780543270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Seasonal Cycles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beyond mere visual spectacle, seasonal transitions imbue the game with additional depth. Each rotation introduces distinct challenges and tactics, offering players a multiplicity of gameplay experiences and quests. Each turn of the seasons presents a fresh challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game fuses quintessential sandbox survival elements, offering freedom and limitless gameplay possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/b4272b8d42d7cc5b37ed197c107226e3.poster.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/b4272b8d42d7cc5b37ed197c107226e3.webm?t=1780543270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: <i><strong>The game is in development. Art, style, and features may change. Future updates will improve details. Thank you for your support!</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Mortal Frame: Reforged in Survival” is a sci-fi RPG combining open-world exploration and sandbox survival. Set in a future shaped by rapid technological advancements, breakthroughs in bioengineering and artificial intelligence present humanity with profound survival challenges and moral dilemmas. Players will explore a mysterious, uncharted island, gathering resources, crafting equipment, capturing AI companions, encountering diverse factions, and enhancing themselves through modifications to face increasingly powerful foes while unraveling the mysteries hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Body Modifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore to collect materials, enhancing or repairing their implanted modification modules to unlock new traits or increase their strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/03f26fafa128be6cf3d83b2f68070ab0.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=324 /></span>      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/782dd2b2d167ba7ed5f705dc8547cc01.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Robot Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can defeat enemies or salvage various types of robot wreckage, converting them into loyal robotic companions through repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Factions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is populated with various factions, each boasting unique stories. Players can delve into their backstory, acquire their technologies and gear, and enjoy a breadth of options and adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Weapons and Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts an arsenal of over 160 weapons and items for players to gather and craft, arming them with an array of combat choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/ec09480949a67080c2f86b542f44c4c0.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Dynamic Climate and Environmental Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game delivers shifting seasons, weather patterns, and robust environmental interaction. Players have the power to alter landscapes and tailor the hues of flora across the seasons, crafting a world that reflects their vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/1e63b9baaa9d5de08ba0f6a529020c65.poster.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/1e63b9baaa9d5de08ba0f6a529020c65.webm?t=1780543270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Seasonal Cycles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beyond mere visual spectacle, seasonal transitions imbue the game with additional depth. Each rotation introduces distinct challenges and tactics, offering players a multiplicity of gameplay experiences and quests. Each turn of the seasons presents a fresh challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game fuses quintessential sandbox survival elements, offering freedom and limitless gameplay possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/b4272b8d42d7cc5b37ed197c107226e3.poster.avif?t=1780543270\" width=550 height=309 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/extras/b4272b8d42d7cc5b37ed197c107226e3.webm?t=1780543270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >: <i><strong>The game is in development. Art, style, and features may change. Future updates will improve details. Thank you for your support!</strong></i></p>", "short_description": "&quot;Mortal Frame&quot; is a sci-fi RPG combining open-world exploration and sandbox survival. The player explores a challenging world, gathers resources, crafts gear, captures AI companions, and upgrades modification chips to enhance their abilities, facing powerful foes and uncovering hidden mysteries.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Russian, Hungarian, Turkish, Greek, Japanese, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Finnish, Arabic, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/header.jpg?t=1780543270", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780543270", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780543270", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</